    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.3/p@125667",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCY.\nThus, while the vulture of sedition\nFeeds in the bosom of such great commanders,\nSleeping neglection doth betray to loss\nThe conquest of our scarce-cold conqueror,\nThat ever-living man of memory,\nHenry the Fifth. Whiles they each other cross,\nLives, honours, lands, and all hurry to loss.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
